 "about": "A municipal office in a bunker audits a zombie for the Bronze Class health plan; it fails, the manager overrides the audit as Philosopher King, and the creature settles for a gray muffin while the assistant names justice a potluck.",
 "beats": [
  {
   "k": "title",
   "mood": "playful and comic"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Muleshoe, Texas, after the end of the world. In a bunker under the Parks and Recreation office, the staff still hold meetings under fluorescent lights.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p1a"
    },
    {
     "place": "p0a"
    }
   ],
   "mood": "playful and comic",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v01.wav",
   "d": 10.775,
   "e": "0zyuvtlyxxxk0tzwxtvvwxwv0vxqzzxufyywvm60",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/e8ccef6d-905c-59b4-8f99-01ccd76181b4/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/f5f5156b-ea5d-5394-8caa-b809cec78e5c.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "Scatter radar: Space research from the ground",
