    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/0551210e-8c25-5521-ab99-e24d7b24a8dc/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/d458a9dc-d0ee-5ea2-857a-e62483978888.mp4",
     "in": 0.6399999999999999,
     "src": "A Monument Reborn: U.S. Post Office & Courthouse, Pittsburgh, PA",
     "y": 2007,
     "q": "p0a"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "JIM"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JIM",
   "text": "So, we've reached the point in the apocalypse where… we're doing benefits. For a zombie.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v03.wav",
   "d": 5.2,
   "e": "00vzyzpswvxuxsukzr00txzuxqqmc3ywvrg00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Strapped to an office chair with bungee cords is a Darkseeker, one of the undead. Today it applies for the Bronze Class health plan.",
   "see": [
    "a man tied to a chair",
    "a clipboard with paper forms"
   ],
   "mood": "tension and suspense",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v04.wav",
   "d": 9.025,
   "e": "0vszvlxxxwxv7zwuth0zzyu30yyvyuwysxwrue00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/9988f47e-c74b-55cc-b195-f16f32d6b2a2/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/06a4fbf0-0381-555f-b85c-e68bfb58cd77.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 20.52,
     "src": "16mm Motion Picture Projector: Operating Techniques, The",
     "y": 1961,
     "q": "a man tied to a chair",
     "fit": 0.342
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/1c5b02f7-87bb-5b3e-9c3d-a6758f606490/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/eca67fca-b4a2-5bc7-bb6c-48ab2da53e1f.mp4",
     "in": 3.0,
     "dur": 21.19,
     "src": "Belmont Historical Society Presents: Richard Betts Remembers, PART II ",
     "y": 2006,
     "q": "a clipboard with paper forms",
     "fit": 0.297
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "DWIGHT"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "The Bronze Class health plan is not a handout. It is a privilege bestowed upon those who demonstrate baseline civic function. Also it includes dental. Which, frankly, they need.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v06.wav",
   "d": 9.6,
   "e": "0zxxvuwyzu0lzxvwwzvzuvvvqxl0xyxwyrvvvo00"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "JED"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "Alright! Today is Open Enrollment. And as Regional Manager and Philosopher King, I want to say one thing: in this Republic, nobody is left behind. Unless Dwight says so. Which is most people. But not today.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v08.wav",
   "d": 12.025,
   "e": "rzyxyyl0zxzxvxwwwytzwxyxuu0zxwswzvjsxw00"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "To qualify, the candidate must not bite anyone for ninety seconds. Dwight sets a kitchen timer, writes its name down as Cletus, and begins the questions.",
   "see": [
    "a kitchen timer",
    "a man writing on a clipboard"
   ],
   "mood": "tension and suspense",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v09.wav",
   "d": 11.0,
   "e": "0xxvuyvvvvxvxvun00zurwxxawtzxtxnjzzusm00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/9c579a7c-d415-5a67-ad21-ba7067ce963b/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/1c839306-f43a-5042-9023-a9ccd0054654.mp4",
     "in": 8.0,
     "dur": 31.06,
     "src": "Incredible Edible Egg in Foodservice",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a kitchen timer",
     "fit": 0.292
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/3d16449f-8fe7-57ce-8d69-1cfa694b2a05/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/2bb6c716-3f14-59d0-a533-4b24cc917b39.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.31,
     "src": "Court to Court (October 2004)",
     "y": 2004,
     "q": "a man writing on a clipboard",
     "fit": 0.319
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "Dwight, remember: the Socratic method is about guiding someone to the truth. Not… intimidating them into compliance.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v10.wav",
   "d": 6.875,
   "e": "0uzyywutzsyvwyuzvytry90qzk0zyzyxvuxnn000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "They are the same thing. Different fonts.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v11.wav",
   "d": 2.475,
   "e": "0000xzzywvnwyyw8yzwvrypysezytlgh00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "Do you want this stapler? So you desire it.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v12.wav",
   "d": 2.8,
   "e": "0009zzxzvpwmewxluvtorxyuxtyywtod00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "Oh! Desire! Great, great. We're starting with appetite.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v13.wav",
   "d": 3.45,
   "e": "000xxtzxxyyqvzsfxxnnwozxxwownqpqgh000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "Now. Is your desire for the stapler guided by reason… or by base appetite? That is not an answer. That is an urge. Reason is quiet. Urge sounds like a leaf blower.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v14.wav",
   "d": 8.6,
   "e": "0yxzzuwuzvzq0szxuutyzypxyvyyuu0zxwwrv200"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "you can't reason with something like that",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/how-do-you-know-it-s-love/clips/0000192092-0000210877.mp4",
   "in": 10.98,
   "d": 2.43,
   "said": "Maybe you would understand better.",
   "src": "How Do You Know It's Love?",
   "y": 1950
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "With thirty seconds left, the Darkseeker gets its teeth into the clipboard and tears off a corner of the forms. Dwight answers with pepper spray. Then the timer rings.",
   "see": [
    "a torn sheet of paper",
    "a kitchen timer ringing"
   ],
   "mood": "something breaking apart",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v16.wav",
   "d": 11.1,
   "e": "0zyxyouyvxsxxuxgyzuywxp6qzyxvxxr0zxzym10",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/35c5e244-6978-501b-85b0-81b519c60f0f/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/81c6f3f3-fb8b-5cd6-97c8-565365673999.mp4",
     "in": 3.0,
     "dur": 8.74,
     "src": "Drive-in Intermission 6",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a torn sheet of paper",
     "fit": 0.362
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/down-the-gasoline-trail/clips/0000427661-0000438338.mp4",
     "in": 4.5,
     "dur": 10.68,
     "src": "Down the Gasoline Trail",
     "y": 1935,
     "q": "a kitchen timer ringing",
     "fit": 0.344
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "Time.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v17.wav",
   "d": 0.85,
   "e": "000000000boppuzzzyxxwwwwuvusroja10000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "So… it qualified?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v18.wav",
   "d": 2.0,
   "e": "0000mrwzzyxzxjjwzzxwktyvtsrnomg000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "No. It bit the clipboard. Also it attempted to unionize my stapler.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v19.wav",
   "d": 4.3,
   "e": "00vzzwxrsxqwq7mzsyvvxtpwzywuvvkyopa00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "I'm overriding.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v20.wav",
   "d": 1.9,
   "e": "00000uzywoxzwtzywuxyxwsuqnmlnj8000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "You cannot override the Audit.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v21.wav",
   "d": 2.25,
   "e": "0000szvozzyxogxzuyxyxyuvvvwvpl6g00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "I can. I'm the Philosopher King.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v22.wav",
   "d": 2.575,
   "e": "0000zvjzyxvmxyyttwzysqrsueuvpkj700000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "Congratulations, Candidate Cletus. You are now Bronze Class. You get: one communal bandage per quarter, access to the gym treadmill bulb on Tuesdays, and vision coverage—",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v23.wav",
   "d": 10.125,
   "e": "0zxxtxxwmxzytvgzo0yzyxsysvvyywyuwtywvj00"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "WE DO NOT HAVE VISION COVERAGE!",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v24.wav",
   "d": 2.425,
   "e": "0000uzzuyyyxrwxwsrzvxvotyqusmhia00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "—of the Good.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v25.wav",
   "d": 1.6,
   "e": "00000bqrzzwosyyuruzxwutrqknpmg0000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "and who is going to pay for all that",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/0e5b3f69-621e-557a-914a-ec33be2602ca/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/becf809d-0c6e-5f50-82b9-2f8a3b1a1cca.mp4",
   "in": 6.5,
   "d": 3.15,
   "said": "The federal government is putting up its share.",
   "src": "It Happens Every Noon",
   "y": 1966
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The new member of Bronze Class goes quiet. Then it lunges, not for a neck, but for the tray of gray communal muffin cubes, and swallows one.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p2a"
    },
    "a tray of muffins on an office table"
   ],
   "mood": "melancholy guitar",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v27.wav",
   "d": 10.175,
   "e": "0zyxzwxvvwl0ozyyoxwza0xxywxyywxxjxwyvm00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/53fda1eb-5481-581a-8e93-eed4930da5ab/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/a1dc3c2a-102d-504e-9dcd-dd7122ed0741.mp4",
     "in": 5.0,
     "src": "Court to Court (Jun 2001)",
     "y": 2001,
     "q": "p2a"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/51bbe5f5-df88-5aeb-be06-dc9132237564/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/313f0773-7834-5e17-a4e7-d3da53aa402b.mp4",
     "in": 9.0,
     "dur": 12.18,
     "src": "Time For Coffee",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a tray of muffins on an office table",
     "fit": 0.346
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "It worked. Consensus.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v28.wav",
   "d": 2.125,
   "e": "0000oztuxzzoarkwxvmqzusiqnkjec7000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "No. That was not consensus. That was hunger settling for policy.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v29.wav",
   "d": 4.0,
   "e": "00rzzxvxzqytzwrnf0twvxyysxwwqmxwmnb00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "JED",
   "text": "Great meeting! Next item: Potluck sign-up sheet.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v30.wav",
   "d": 3.3,
   "e": "000wzsxzxxwzsnxxtrmnzpznozwvgmtoh6000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "DWIGHT",
   "text": "The meeting started. The world ended. Justice is… apparently… a potluck.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep03/v31.wav",
   "d": 4.3,
   "e": "00vzzyoyzwswytwztqxnswqbpyysuooxro000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Outside the bunker doors, the rest of the Darkseekers are knocking to get in.",
